  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JSB-Addressing the climate crisis and human security through NDC planning and implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to catalyse the market and strengthen the ecosystem for DRE-powered productive end-use applications &#x2013;creating and enhancing livelihood opportunities, particularly for women and vulnerable populations &#x2013;fostering local socio-economic growth in rural and remote areas. The proposed project also aims to support the development of a livelihoods transition framework for heavily coal dependent states (Odisha and Jharkhand). The approach adopted will be inclusive and gender responsive and will aim to maximize impacts through partnerships and strengthening the institutional mechanisms and capacity of local communities to ensure long term sustainability of these interventions, thereby preventing and mitigating climate impacts on key aspects of human including economy, society, and health.</narrative>
  </description>
